\f0\b\fs28 \cf2 Special Population Adaptations\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0
\fs24 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Masters Athletes ($\\ge 45$ Years)
\f1\b0 : Connective tissue remodeling rates are prolonged relative to muscular recovery. 
\fs30 \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 PlanKit
\fs24 \cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  caps progressive volume accumulation at $+1\\text\{ set/week\}$, applies a $0.85\\times$ scalar to calculated MRV caps, and mandates a recovery deload every 4th microcycle.\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Layoff Returnees ($\\ge 3$ Weeks Un-trained)
\f1\b0 : Muscular adaptation baseline resets while vulnerability to exercise-induced muscle damage increases. The engine sets Microcycle 1 volume to Maintenance Volume ($MV \\approx 6\\text\{ sets/week\}$), progressing to $MEV$ in Microcycle 2.\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 High Stress / Low Sleep (ARC $< 0.45$ 7-Day Average)
\f1\b0 : Systemic recovery capacity is compromised. 
\fs30 \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 PlanKit
\fs24 \cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  clamps peak mesocycle volume to $MEV + 2\\text\{ sets\}$, overriding progressive set ramps until systemic readiness metrics normalize.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf2 \strokec2 Overreaching Detection & MRV Threshold Enforcements\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 To prevent overtraining, 
\fs30 \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 PlanKit
\fs24 \cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  establishes two MRV boundary limits:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Soft Warning Cap ($MRV_\{soft\} = 0.90 \\times MRV$)
\f1\b0 : The LLM Coach alerts the athlete that recovery capacity is reaching saturation. Progressive volume additions are halved.\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Hard Operational Cap ($MRV_\{hard\} = 1.00 \\times MRV$)
\f1\b0 : The engine strictly rejects set additions beyond this ceiling regardless of user adjustments.\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Overreaching Alarm
\f1\b0 : If a muscle group logs a Performance Rating of $4$ for two consecutive microcycles while operating at or above $MRV_\{soft\}$, the engine terminates the active mesocycle and schedules a 7-day reactive deload.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

