\f0\b\fs28 \cf2 Deterministic Acceptance Checklist\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls12\ilvl0
\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 [ ] 
\f0\b AC-101: Pattern Diversity Floor
\f1\b0 : Every generated Push, Pull, and Legs session with a duration budget $\\ge 45\\text\{ minutes\}$ must contain $\\ge 3$ distinct exercise slots representing $\\ge 2$ unique movement patterns.\
\ls12\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 [ ] 
\f0\b AC-102: Defect Elimination
\f1\b0 : No Pull session generated under standard readiness ($\\text\{ARC\} \\ge 0.70$) and non-deload states shall contain $< 3$ exercises unless the user time budget is set to $30\\text\{ minutes\}$.\
\ls12\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 [ ] 
\f0\b AC-103: Dynamic Gating Floor Protection
\f1\b0 : No sequence of low ARC readiness scores shall depress total weekly volume below $MV$ ($6\\text\{ sets/muscle/week\}$) for more than 2 consecutive microcycles.\
\ls12\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 [ ] 
\f0\b AC-104: Hard MRV Cap Enforcement
\f1\b0 : Under no condition shall 
\fs30 \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 PlanKit
\fs24 \cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  allocate a weekly set target exceeding $MRV_\{hard\}$ for any target muscle group.\
\ls12\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 [ ] 
\f0\b AC-105: Equipment Constraint Invariance
\f1\b0 : The exercise array output by 
\fs30 \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 PrescriptionEngine
\fs24 \cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  must contain zero exercises requiring equipment absent from the active 
\fs30 \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 EquipmentMask
\fs24 \cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 .\
\ls12\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 [ ] 
\f0\b AC-106: Deterministic Re-Plan Replicability
\f1\b0 : Given identical input states (User Profile, Seeding Prior, ARC Score, Soreness/Performance Ratings), the engine must produce bit-level identical session structures across execution runs.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf2 \strokec2 Property-Based Testing Specifications\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf7 \cb8 \strokec7 Property 1: Session Duration Upper Bound Constraints\
For all TimeBudgets T in \{30, 45, 60, 75\},\
For all UserProfiles P with valid EquipmentMasks,\
  Let ResolvedSession = SessionComposer.Compose(P, T)\
  Assert ResolvedSession.TotalEstimatedDuration <= T * 1.05\
\
Property 2: Overlap Synergy Credit Accounting Accuracy\
For all GeneratedSessions S,\
  Let DirectSets = Sum(S.Exercises.Filter(PrimeMover).Sets)\
  Let SynergySets = Sum(S.Exercises.Filter(Synergist).Sets * 0.5)\
  Assert TotalVolumeCredit(TargetMuscle) == DirectSets + SynergySets\
\
Property 3: Readiness Volume Non-Inversion\
For all ARC Readiness Scores R1, R2 where R1 < R2,\
  Let PrescribedVolume1 = PrescriptionEngine.Generate(R1)\
  Let PrescribedVolume2 = PrescriptionEngine.Generate(R2)\
  Assert PrescribedVolume1.TotalSets <= PrescribedVolume2.TotalSets\
\
Property 4: Pain Constraint Exclusion Safety\
For all ActivePainConstraints C in UserProfile,\
  Let ProhibitedPatterns = Matrix.GetProhibitedPatterns(C)\
  Let GeneratedSession = SessionComposer.Compose(UserProfile)\
  Assert Intersection(GeneratedSession.MovementPatterns, ProhibitedPatterns) == EmptySet\
}